{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:00 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"璀璨之城結局篇 | 張曦雯半裸肉搏張智霖重頭戲終曝光 一鏡到底崩潰爆喊 挑戰入行最震撼尺度\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/348be9c8306c34c8f9819ded4c682a8e/2026-11/ENT___11.jpg\"/>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》本周五（11月6日）將播出大結局，劇情推進至失控邊緣，Alice（高海寧飾）和Kate（張曦雯飾）兩妯娌與及Sarah（陳瀅飾）分別被官家人逼到失控邊緣。在昨晚（3日）片尾播出的預告上，看到半裸張曦雯站在張智霖面前，預告中還有一幕是她隔著浴室玻璃、赤裸面對鏡頭崩潰落淚的畫面，利用淚水與水花交織出角色的委屈與痛苦。張曦雯備受矚目的半裸大露背重頭戲終於正式曝光。</p>\n<h2>張曦雯半裸大露背重頭戲終於曝光</h2>\n<p>張曦雯這場跟張智霖上演一場長達7分鐘、大尺度除剩底褲的肉搏羞辱重頭戲曝光，曾惹來不少爭議，曾有指這場極限挑戰要在鏡頭前「一Shot過」完成，張曦雯更要半裸上身，僅穿底褲與張智霖貼身肉搏。期間她還會被對方扯頭髮，極盡羞辱之能事。張曦雯還透露最初接獲劇本時只要求穿內衣褲上陣，尺度尚算溫和，沒料到正式拍攝時，監製陳維冠臨場加碼，要求挑戰超高難度的一鏡到底（One Take）大露背鏡頭。</p>\n<img alt=\"江美儀和張曦雯在結局篇上演的婆媳大戰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7fb6925859e25039896bb1933d1acd0/2026-11/02_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江美儀獲封「瘋批高手」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3065a66e0db0d4d911f394c08c7a5511/2026-11/03_1_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"美儀姐入型入格的「惡霸野蠻奶奶」演繹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36eb463d02270fa3eeaa5feb243ff272/2026-11/04_7_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Kelly極不忿氣的駁嘴狀態，不少網民大表肉緊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9b7d238e19c74b6644531a48ccf1c81/2026-11/06_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯於《璀璨之城》將半裸除剩底褲肉搏張智霖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8271fe433ddcd1d6c712988fe673edd8/2026-10/1_4_93.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯貢獻從影以來最性感演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33a40475d36a4f879bf7410e0a87e3c5/2026-10/A_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Kate（張曦雯飾）被官家人逼到失控邊緣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/079c3bf67f7aea40597fc4a868e745b3/2026-11/VS--17--myTVSUPER-42_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在昨晚（3日）片尾播出的預告上，看到半裸張曦雯站在張智霖面前\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/012c6e692a2e4137ee98c4e7d3e70573/2026-11/VS--17--myTVSUPER-42_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"預告中還有一幕是她隔著浴室玻璃、赤裸面對鏡頭崩潰落淚的畫面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3741a3da1c65546549f74005279d834f/2026-11/VS--17--myTVSUPER-43_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯備受矚目的半裸大露背重頭戲終於正式曝光。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a68fe33109b55c6953a12ec19d5cfd76/2026-11/VS--17--myTVSUPER-43_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯這場跟張智霖上演一場長達7分鐘重頭戲曾惹來不少爭議。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4e12a1b164c1de89d051a01e5fc67c6/2026-11/VS--17--myTVSUPER-43_36_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯曾一度拒演，其後獲袁詠儀及江美儀力勸拍裸戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc23cb9abce06bd5c5c9db5ffcbc0854/2026-10/2_2_86.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"經不起奶奶一再奚落的Kate，終決定不再啞忍爆Seed反擊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf1d4ac24de488e5892b6376b6c78f78/2026-11/07_2_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「準時食藥呀奶奶，如果唔係就要返精神病院架喇！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54348e42737f712e202e65debae11f8d/2026-11/09_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"丁麗明：「咁你唔去死？嫁畀我個仔咁耐，乜都冇做過，冇嘢幫到阿君架！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21823f2edca37624ac73131ce1134be9/2026-11/10_1_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"氣得丁麗明即時出掌兼瘋狂捶打阿Kate\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/278b2fdc069cd10512479747518d9ba4/2026-11/13_5_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"越鬧越興奮的丁麗明，還出言侮辱Kate與孝賢（張智霖飾）出軌，言詞非常難聽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1208b96f3de4b596807fb0ec74de69b0/2026-11/14_4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Kate一度想出手還拖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e97a95d107ba828afb8b7e49aaccedfb/2026-11/16_3_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"丁麗明即時發爛渣：「你連我都想打？」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1fedae006df4ad5fee05859d2039de60/2026-11/17_3_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"丁麗明則繼續發癲：「望咩呀？打我吖！嚟吖！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4b24b116c4b347dcc758e1d3dd3ed9c/2026-11/19_3_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Kate飽受「野蠻奶奶」狙擊及老公孝君「漠視」雙重打擊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/072d0945a9e77cab1112646f00e98fbc/2026-11/24_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"最終積怨成魔推奶奶落樓梯\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5731a843abb9c7437dc5ddb029526f4e/2026-11/26_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"丁麗明多處骨折\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ceaa93a43472b22f722de4887936586d/2026-11/29_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"因而觸動孝君神經被離婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9c75485111c15ff0f815eba72ab4924/2026-11/30_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雖然Kelly與美儀姐劇中關係緊張，但其實二人私下相處十分愉快\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/887a3a80bed612eadf7b23a17b567115/2026-11/33_0.jpg\"/>\n<h2>張曦雯拍攝這場戲曾鬧出極大風波</h2>\n<p>張曦雯當日拍攝這場戲曾鬧出極大風波，有傳監製陳維冠在拍攝當天臨場要求將原本的內衣戲改為「除剩底褲」的大露背，令張曦雯一度強烈拒拍，現場更因此停工。其後劇組因修改劇本停工近3個月。復拍期間，張智霖太太袁詠儀前來探班，與江美儀、張曦雯等人一同聚餐。席間眾人重提這場重頭戲，江美儀向張曦雯耐心剖析角色，袁詠儀更承諾拍攝當日會親自到場「監場」並幫忙清場，確保私隱，結果張曦雯終衝破心理防線，翌日主動向監製答應親身上陣，奉獻出入行以來最性感、最大膽的演出。</p>\n<h2>張曦雯曾表示覺得很大尺度抗拒演出</h2>\n<p>對於這場未播已引起爭議的風波，張曦雯曾表示收到劇本後覺得很大尺度，抗拒演出，監製陳維冠知道後也提出不同拍攝方案，但強調劇集停拍並非因她不肯演出，而是她和吳卓羲的角色和劇情上有很大的修改，她看過修改後的劇本覺得合理，加上對團隊的信任，與及與兩位前輩袁詠儀和江美儀傾過才決定拍攝。張曦雯更表示：「呢場戲其實和除唔除衫無關，是關於情緒上的推進，7分鐘5頁紙對白，cut shot拍和一鏡直落係完全唔同，一鏡直落要做好多準備，各方面都要配合得好好，排都排幾個鐘，正式拍嗰陣都拍咗幾個鐘。（今次是性感極限？）要睇劇情接唔接受到。」她亦強調，自己拍裸戲沒有被施壓，也與「唔輸得」無關。監製陳維冠亦曾否認加戲，重申尺度由頭到尾無變，但因原本是想cut shot拍，其後認為這場戲的情緒和節奏都一鏡到底的話，震撼性會更高，張曦雯早已知道，只不過一開始她是糾結個難度，因為真係好複雜。</p>\n<h2>璀璨之城丨張智霖好有艷福：</h2>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）好有艷福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/590c9febf1eb2233a5800c8c136f1473/2026-10/25_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）首集即與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）激烈擁吻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14846d6c826ce6245c6bb8052a23a080/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_38_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）的手更從女方腰間游走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddb818096cc437eedf20a637c9770076/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甚至伸入裙內。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad716321577daae033c6bde0a6effa3b/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）狀甚享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cc0369563305eee71c83dfa8904d81a/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_53_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"角度相當曖昧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ead3c425881cb850ebb64a689ec42afa/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）雖然穿得密實，但二人互動卻相當有Feel。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/669cf6df9fe406411b87c8f9dc0f0acd/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅為了與張智霖達成利益交易，見面時先交出手機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de424f6f6c84f9891313000cd918532/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-39_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動上演一幕極致大膽的「全裸誘惑」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83743d39e7bdff9a3ca23bbdcf29ea5a/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動除衫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec2a0bf2664d3da794b445574fb1d008/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅先露出黑bra。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/069c4b785d8fff50b28620a68d4e9886/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅再除下牛仔褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a860436763614915049fcb334c21cf/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅露出蜜桃臀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b60bf2304a1174ede90d77d2272bf24f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖一臉嫌棄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0a392d28d7c5b83b89ec34e6d6353ea/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅繼續出招。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af8eec1a8833823d1ededd8c650d96d9/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖冷眼看陳瀅下一步行動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1c10c13a7b96c17a14dcbb4ad8b6ee0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備坐在床上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cecd73e938289986dabac79ba39a60f3/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備除下內褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8149e85dc649e4f12896e9152e9fd23f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意識相當大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d29a5dfd593bded778b4c5d294d82103/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅解開胸罩背扣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4b85d35644c9fbb3f1b10702f44edce/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅大晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccb8f8e39a22a94262b1e4541a6ac078/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅盡騷一流身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/788683d4835a23c8b9991bcb0bc64722/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅即將一絲不掛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6c2e91f929731a4b6aee6e1e55d2f7f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅將身上衣物全數脫光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aca8a442d4b89f2bc87ddb838be0aa61/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅躺在床上腿張開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adefb06c8d8aaa2aa0d4695f5ba845b2/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅任影唔嬲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bfaf8f92d5af7d2835c6620e6a2455c/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"首次挑戰大膽除衫戲，陳瀅坦言現場緊張萬分。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/583bea3e5581a451cd8e3929fb751ac0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅又稱收到劇本已經很喜歡這場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cca90a71763a069064ec774e63063377/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_05_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:46:10.981439+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1081,"images":54,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:19:12.285199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:39:10.077628+00:00","content_hash":"2ef22ca8c13c6f53200e9dddd38765dc839a5b708716884999c5a394b6835e1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}